rinthine hallyway, dim lighting, strange objects in passages, sudden scares, it recreating the horrific scares of a nightmare experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Floor 9: No Man's Town, you've woken up, but where are all the people in the city?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are three endings in the game, I hope you enjoy playing it.</p>","developers":["ZHANG FAN"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169330/header.jpg?t=1741165789","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 2060 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS 10.6+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 2060 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257046411,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257046411/movie480.mp4?t=1723944714","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257046411/movie_max.mp4?t=1723944714"},"name":"video","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257046411/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1723944714","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257046411/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1723944714","max"